    {
      "id": "rule-444fb487",
      "tag": "rule",
      "text": "Never report a command as done until the Apple TV's state has been read back and agrees with it — a keypress over the network fails silently, so every send ends in exactly one of verified, mismatch or unverifiable, and only the first is ever called done.",
